  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: (28×2)−16×6+8×3+5×7=39\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the numbers :\n\nOption 1) 5 and 3\n\n(28 × 2) − 16 × 6 + 8 × 3 + 5 × 7 = 39 ⇒ (28 × 2) − 16 × 6 + 8 × 5 + 3 × 7 = 39\n\n⇒ __**(28 × **____**2**____**)**__ − 16 × 6 + 8 × 5 + 3 × 7 = 39\n\n⇒ 56 − __**16 × **____**6**__ + __**8 × **____**5**__ + __**3 × **____**7**__ = 39\n\n⇒ __**56 + 40**____** **____**+ 21**__ − 96 = 39\n\n⇒ **__117__**__** − 96**__ = 39\n\n⇒ 21 ≠ 39 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) 8 and 7\n\n(28 × 2) − 16 × 6 + 8 × 3 + 5 × 7 = 39 ⇒ (28 × 2) − 16 × 6 + 7 × 3 + 5 × 8 = 39\n\n⇒ __**(28 × **____**2**____**)**__ − 16 × 6 + 7 × 3 + 5 × 8 = 39\n\n⇒ 56 − __**16 × **____**6**__ + __**7 × **____**3**__ + __**5 × **____**8**__ = 39\n\n⇒ __**56 + 21**____** **____**+ 40**__ − 96 = 39\n\n⇒ __**117**____** − 96**__ = 39\n\n⇒ 21 ≠ 39 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) 6 and 7\n\n(28 × 2) − 16 × 6 + 8 × 3 + 5 × 7 = 39 ⇒ (28 × 2) − 16 × 7 + 8 × 3 + 5 × 6 = 39\n\n⇒ __**(28 × **____**2**____**)**__ − 16 × 7 + 8 × 3 + 5 × 6 = 39\n\n⇒ 56 − __**16 × **____**7**__ + __**8 × **____**3**__ + __**5 × **____**6**__ = 39\n\n⇒ __**56 + 24**____** + 30**__ − 91 = 39\n\n⇒ __**110**____** − 91**__ = 39\n\n⇒ 19 ≠ 39 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) 2 and 3\n\n(28 × 2) − 16 × 6 + 8 × 3 + 5 × 7 = 39 ⇒ (28 × 3) − 16 × 6 + 8 × 2 + 5 × 7 = 39\n\n⇒ __**(28 × **____**3**____**)**__ − 16 × 6 + 8 × 2 + 5 × 7 = 39\n\n⇒ 84 − __**16 × **____**6**__ + __**8 × **____**2**__ + __**5 × **____**7**__ = 39\n\n⇒ __**84 + 16**____** + 35**__ − 96 = 39\n\n⇒ __**135**____** − 96**__ = 39\n\n⇒ **39 = 39 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nHence, \"Option 4\" is the correct answer.",
